IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROBE-S19.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT IN-FILE ASSIGN TO "input.dat"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO "output.dat"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD IN-FILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 IN-TEXT PIC X(8).
FD OUT-FILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-TEXT PIC X(8).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 SMALL PIC S9(2) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE VALUE 42.
01 FLAG PIC X(1) VALUE "N".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    DISPLAY SMALL FLAG
    ADD 100 TO SMALL ON SIZE ERROR MOVE "H" TO FLAG END-ADD
    DISPLAY SMALL FLAG
    STOP RUN.
